{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1758797,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Essay Competition","festival_id":515345,"organization_id":1004474,"web_url":"qis-kit-fall-fest-2026.vercel.app\/","start_date":"2026-09-23T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-12T23:59:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/essay-competition-srm-university-ap-1758797","region":"online","details":"<p>The <strong>Essay Competition<\/strong> is part of <strong>Day 3 &ndash; Advanced Applications &amp; Hackathon Launch<\/strong> at <strong>Qiskit Fall Fest 2026, SRM University-AP, Amaravati<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Participants are invited to showcase their writing skills, creativity, critical thinking, and understanding of quantum computing and emerging technologies through an original essay based on one of the following themes.<\/p>\n<h3>Essay Competition Themes<\/h3>\n<ol start=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Quantum Renaissance:<\/strong> Reimagining the Future of Human Civilization<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Beyond the Bit:<\/strong> How Quantum Thinking Could Redefine Intelligence<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Quantum Cloud:<\/strong> Democratizing the Power of Tomorrow<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>When Quantum Meets AI:<\/strong> The Dawn of a New Intelligence Era<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Race for Quantum Supremacy:<\/strong> Innovation, Collaboration, or Competition?<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Uncertainty Advantage:<\/strong> Finding Opportunity in the Quantum World<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>From Amaravati to the World:<\/strong> Building India&rsquo;s Quantum-Powered Future<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Quantum Divide:<\/strong> Who Will Control the Technology of Tomorrow?<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Can Quantum Computers Help Save a Warming Planet?<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The End of Digital Secrecy?<\/strong> Rethinking Privacy in the Quantum Age<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Butterfly Effect of Quantum Innovation:<\/strong> Small Discoveries, Global Transformations<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quantum Computing Without Borders:<\/strong> A Future of Open Science and Shared Discovery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Quantum Entrepreneur:<\/strong> Turning Complex Science into Everyday Solutions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>A World of Superposition:<\/strong> Exploring the Future of Choices, Possibilities, and Computation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Human Mind in a Quantum World:<\/strong> Can Creativity Outpace Computing Power?<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quantum Ethics:<\/strong> Who Should Set the Rules for a Technology We Barely Understand?<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>From Qubits to Quantum Cities:<\/strong> Imagining the Infrastructure of 2050<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The Next Great Scientific Revolution:<\/strong> Is Quantum Computing Ready to Change Everything?<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quantum for the Common Good:<\/strong> Making Breakthrough Science Matter to Ordinary People<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>A Decade of Quantum on the Cloud:<\/strong> The Next Ten Years of Discovery and Innovation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Beyond the Quantum Lab:<\/strong> Can Amaravati&rsquo;s Quantum Reference Facility at SRM University-AP Accelerate India&rsquo;s Journey from Quantum Research to Real-World Innovation?<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quantum in 2898 AD:<\/strong> Imagining Civilization, Intelligence, and Life in a Quantum-Powered Future<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Quantum at the Edge of Imagination:<\/strong> An Open Theme on the Future of Quantum Science and Technology<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>Participants are encouraged to present their ideas clearly, support their arguments with relevant information, and approach their chosen theme with originality, thoughtful reasoning, and creativity.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Submission Deadline:<\/strong> 12 October 2026, 11:59 PM IST.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Note:<\/strong> All submissions must be original and received before the deadline. Late submissions will not be considered.<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Certificate will be provided for  participant","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":33285520,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-20T09:48:52+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T07:21:41+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"h0ike4m","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":454,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-09-20 09:53:53","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"closed_at":null,"linkedInEventId":"","teams":[],"players":[],"logoUrl":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/75x75\/uploadedManual-6aaf5eb6c275a_whatsapp_image_2026-09-19_at_6_31_49_pm.jpeg","logoUrl2":"https:\/\/d8it4huxumps7.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/images\/150x150\/uploadedManual-6aaf5eb6c275a_whatsapp_image_2026-09-19_at_6_31_49_pm.jpeg","regnRequirements":{"id":2490307,"opportunity_id":1758797,"festival_id":null,"max_team_size":1,"min_team_size":1,"start_regn_dt":"2026-09-23T00:00:00+05:30","end_regn_dt":"2026-10-10T23:59:34+05:30","show_deadline":1,"open_for":0,"college_type":0,"same_organisation":0,"study_year_filter":0,"deleted_at":null,"eligibility":null,"gender":["A"],"vendor_id":null,"verified_email":1,"ver